This directory is intentionally empty of real vocabulary data.

Real bundle files (vocab_a1.json, vocab_a2.json, ..., vocab_c1.json — see
DATA_MODEL.md §11.2) are produced by a developer-side script after CSV
import, not by Claude and not checked into this repo by an AI session.
This placeholder exists only so the directory itself survives a fresh
git clone/checkout, since git does not track empty directories, and so
the `assets:` declaration in pubspec.yaml points at something real.

Delete this file once the first real vocab_*.json file lands here.
